sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Client A (Browser)
    participant R as Reverb :8080
    participant S as Laravel (event dispatcher)
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant B as Client B (Browser)

    A->>S: PATCH /workspaces/w1/projects/p1/tasks/42
    S->>DB: UPDATE tasks SET status = 'in_progress' WHERE id = 42
    S->>S: cycle detection BFS over task_dependencies
    S->>S: cascade revert if old status was 'done'
    S-->>S: broadcast(new TaskUpdated($task))->toOthers()
    S->>R: POST /apps/events { channel: presence-project.1, name: TaskUpdated, data: {...} }
    R-->>B: WS push on presence-project.1 with TaskUpdated payload
    B->>B: router.reload({ only: ['board'] })
    A-->>A: original PATCH returns 302 redirect
